<title>UK: Lehman Brothers sets warrants on lire/mark.</title>
<headline>Lehman Brothers sets warrants on lire/mark.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1996-12-09</dateline>
<text>
<p>Lehman Brothers Finance SA has issued five million European-style corridor warrants, in two equal tranches, on the Official Bank of Italy lire/mark fixing, lead manager Lehman Brothers Bankhaus AG said.</p>
<p> WARRANTS     ISS PRICE  RANGES   LOWER  UPPER</p>
<p> TRANCHE ONE  3.65 DEM   RANGE 1  970    1000</p>
<p>				 RANGE 2  965    1005</p>
<p>				 RANGE 3  960    1010</p>
<p>				 RANGE 4  955    1015</p>
<p> TRANCHE TWO  4.65 DEM   RANGE 1  970    1000</p>
<p>				 RANGE 2  965    1005</p>
<p>				 RANGE 3  955    1015</p>
<p>				 RANGE 4  950    1030</p>
<p> MATURITY DATE   06.JUN.97		 PAYDATE	11.DEC.96</p>
<p> LISTING	   FFT STG DDF	     MIN EXER LOT 100</p>
<p> SPOT REFERENCE  980</p>
<p>--Reuter London Newsroom +44 171 542 7658</p>
